{"id": "34498", "title": "小龟慢慢爬", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34498.htm", "intro": "慢、真慢、有够慢！这小妮子是怎样，迟缓儿吗？问她话，会意、思考、回答花个三分钟，没耐心的他险些拿头撞墙，直想按快转，不过看她被两个姊姊欺凌、苦毒，他这正义小天使忍不住跳出来，从数千名莺燕中，选这只小乌龟当助理，还将被忌妒的姊姊锁在门外的她拎回家，而且后果似乎没有想像中惨烈，慢工出细活，所以她经手的事皆极完美，可是想不到乌龟暍醉也是有杀伤力的，不但猛啃他的背还把他当树爬，而他这才发现，原来她身材如此喷火，天啊！他快忍不住了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34498", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188795.html", "av